 "description": "Make every day a weekend. With the all-new Aquila 45 Sport power catamaran, every outing becomes an opportunity to turn good plans into unforgettable adventures.\nSharp, sleek styling inspired by contemporary luxury SUVs meets advanced double-stepped hull technology that delivers top speeds above 50 mph and efficient 38-40 mph cruising—getting you where you want to be, when you want to be there. The expansive aft cockpit with fold-down terraces creates an unmatched 19-foot social space with convertible U-shaped seating and manual high/low table.\nFirst-in-class connectivity puts full control at your fingertips—manage underwater lighting, multi-color LED accents, C-Zone systems, Raymarine navigation, Mercury engines, and Fusion stereo directly from your smart device. The four-seat helm station, comfortable cabin with private head, and optional advanced lithium system deliver exceptional value whether running day charters, exploring dive spots, enjoying weekend getaways, or hosting unforgettable days with friends and family.",
